      "id": 999,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Expense Detail** - penyebab di balik gejala service `expense`. Gejala level platform: [Services Overview](/d/services-overview). Struktur: RED per route (pengalaman user) di atas, lalu USE resource (pgx / S3 / Kafka-Outbox) di bawah.\n\n- Pool pgx menempel di `max` + `empty-acquire` naik = saturasi koneksi DB.\n- Draft lahir dari OCR (tidak ada POST /transactions): upload nota di Documents, draft muncul via event."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HTTP RED - service terpilih",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate per route & status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
